'''Ornaments''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It uses the same design as the [[Default Knife]] in the exception of the three large ornaments attached to the blade, hence the name. The ornament closest to the tip is a green, the ornament in the center is blue, and the one near the heel is a red.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Ornaments (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
